		{
			"id": "tom1B5zaFZD31LSiG",
			"name": "Sense of Duty (the herd, and the dogs)",
			"reference": "B153",
			"local_notes": "Not the order. He works for the herd and is here to handle dogs, and if the two duties ever pull against each other the priests will lose and will be astonished.",
			"tags": [
				"Disadvantage",
				"Mental"
			],
			"base_points": -5,
			"calc": {
				"points": -5
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "th3i_ByQvi3myW7-O",
			"name": "Bad Temper (15)",
			"reference": "B124",
			"local_notes": "Self-control 15, so it is rare - and it is reliably triggered by being asked to explain how he does it. You are asking him to explain his hands. B124",
			"tags": [
				"Disadvantage",
				"Mental"
			],
			"base_points": -5,
